(7443545, 1177235, 96751, '<td valign="top">The shapes and harmonizing colors, and the hint of laughing. at what...? and the slight grossness of scratching... :)</td>', 'The shapes and harmonizing colors, and the hint of laughing. at what...? and the slight grossness of scratching... :)', '2016-03-11 11:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443546, 1177191, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wow. Haunting</td>', 'Wow. Haunting', '2016-03-11 11:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443547, 1177345, 30861, '<td valign="top">There''ll always be a snaffles<br/>Where there''s a crazy dame...<br/> <br/>(sung to the tune of "There''ll always be an England" :-)<br/> <br/>Love it!</td>', 'There''ll always be a snafflesWhere there''s a crazy dame... (sung to the tune of "There''ll always be an England" :-) Love it!', '2016-03-11 11:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443560, 1177298, 96751, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the lonely isolation of living in a high density, highrise city.<br/> <br/>What''s even better is I know exactly where this is! That building on the far left is the "lipstick building" in NY. On 3rd and 53rd Street. Which means this was shot in a building on the west side of 3rd Ave, and the south side of 53rd :)  <br/> <br/>160 E. 53rd to be exact :)<br/> <br/>Many years ago, I used to live at 246 :)</td>', 'You''ve captured the lonely isolation of living in a high density, highrise city. What''s even better is I know exactly where this is! That building on the far left is the "lipstick building" in NY. On 3rd and 53rd Street. Which means this was shot in a building on the west side of 3rd Ave, and the south side of 53rd :)   160 E. 53rd to be exact :) Many years ago, I used to live at 246 :)', '2016-03-11 11:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443561, 1177325, 96751, '<td valign="top">One of her lesser known works....?</td>', 'One of her lesser known works....?', '2016-03-11 11:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443562, 1177089, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hahaha! Oh brilliant. If Ken were still around, I would peg this as his :)</td>', 'Hahaha! Oh brilliant. If Ken were still around, I would peg this as his :)', '2016-03-11 11:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443563, 1177342, 96751, '<td valign="top">Her blue period...?</td>', 'Her blue period...?', '2016-03-11 11:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443564, 1177356, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh wow. Tate, you take the cake. And my pick for the blue :)</td>', 'Oh wow. Tate, you take the cake. And my pick for the blue :)', '2016-03-11 12:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443567, 1177307, 96751, '<td valign="top">A wonderful melding of her portraits and film series. Love it.</td>', 'A wonderful melding of her portraits and film series. Love it.', '2016-03-11 12:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443568, 1177359, 96751, '<td valign="top">Samantha! You''ve gone red!</td>', 'Samantha! You''ve gone red!', '2016-03-11 12:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443640, 1177359, 59737, '<td valign="top">I think you nailed it, little bit strange and quirky with a good pose and look, processing and background look like her style as well.</td>', 'I think you nailed it, little bit strange and quirky with a good pose and look, processing and background look like her style as well.', '2016-03-11 17:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443641, 1177340, 59737, '<td valign="top">She''d make a good subject for a Cindy Sherman photo but as it is a street photo don''t feel it meets her style</td>', 'She''d make a good subject for a Cindy Sherman photo but as it is a street photo don''t feel it meets her style', '2016-03-11 17:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443642, 1177298, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, well shot with good lighting, not as strange as how I picture Cindy''s work and I associate her with color although I know she shoots some black and white.</td>', 'Nice photo, well shot with good lighting, not as strange as how I picture Cindy''s work and I associate her with color although I know she shoots some black and white.', '2016-03-11 17:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443644, 1177299, 59737, '<td valign="top">strange look and processing on this.  If it were more in focus I could see this being like Cindy Sherman.  The buck in the background is just freaky looking.</td>', 'strange look and processing on this.  If it were more in focus I could see this being like Cindy Sherman.  The buck in the background is just freaky looking.', '2016-03-11 17:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443645, 1177356, 59737, '<td valign="top">makes me laugh, the make-up on the nose and neck is a great touch, I could see Cindy shooting something like this.</td>', 'makes me laugh, the make-up on the nose and neck is a great touch, I could see Cindy shooting something like this.', '2016-03-11 17:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443646, 1177345, 59737, '<td valign="top">To me this is a little too straightforward of a portrait to be in the style of Cindy.  I see her images as more quirky and with many of them having a a dark side to them.  This is does have some quirkiness but not the dark side.</td>', 'To me this is a little too straightforward of a portrait to be in the style of Cindy.  I see her images as more quirky and with many of them having a a dark side to them.  This is does have some quirkiness but not the dark side.', '2016-03-11 17:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443647, 1177342, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of a bird but not the style of Cindy Sherman</td>', 'Nice photo of a bird but not the style of Cindy Sherman', '2016-03-11 17:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443648, 1177089, 59737, '<td valign="top">the background is right for a lot of Cindy''s photos that I looked at, usually like the photos with woodies in them but this doesn''t work for me in this case.</td>', 'the background is right for a lot of Cindy''s photos that I looked at, usually like the photos with woodies in them but this doesn''t work for me in this case.', '2016-03-11 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443650, 1177350, 59737, '<td valign="top">Not how I would picture a Cindy Sherman photo, it does have a strangeness to it that I find interesting.</td>', 'Not how I would picture a Cindy Sherman photo, it does have a strangeness to it that I find interesting.', '2016-03-11 17:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443651, 1177325, 59737, '<td valign="top">very nice photo and great colors, I don''t know of any Cindy Sherman still life or flower photos so don''t feel this meets the challenge but I do enjoy the photo.</td>', 'very nice photo and great colors, I don''t know of any Cindy Sherman still life or flower photos so don''t feel this meets the challenge but I do enjoy the photo.', '2016-03-11 17:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443652, 1177191, 59737, '<td valign="top">Disturbing look to this photo, I found some of Cindy''s photos disturbing but in a different way than this.  I found Cindy''s photos disturbing more in an uncomfortable sense like maybe we were seeing a part of person they keep hidden. This photo to me is disturbing in a creepy sense.</td>', 'Disturbing look to this photo, I found some of Cindy''s photos disturbing but in a different way than this.  I found Cindy''s photos disturbing more in an uncomfortable sense like maybe we were seeing a part of person they keep hidden. This photo to me is disturbing in a creepy sense.', '2016-03-11 17:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443653, 1177339, 59737, '<td valign="top">Bold photo, great lighting, exposure and focus.  The stare is intense penetrating.  Well done but to me lacks the odd, quirky side of many of Cindy''s photos.</td>', 'Bold photo, great lighting, exposure and focus.  The stare is intense penetrating.  Well done but to me lacks the odd, quirky side of many of Cindy''s photos.', '2016-03-11 17:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443654, 1177346, 59737, '<td valign="top">Like what you were going for here there''s an ominous feeling about this like in many of Cindy''s untitled film stills.  The underexposure doesn''t work for me, a little bit of light on the left side of the face to give some definition would have been great.</td>', 'Like what you were going for here there''s an ominous feeling about this like in many of Cindy''s untitled film stills.  The underexposure doesn''t work for me, a little bit of light on the left side of the face to give some definition would have been great.', '2016-03-11 17:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443655, 1177354, 59737, '<td valign="top">Love it, all the things to look at, looks like you built a story around this person, the clothes, shoes, the point of the toes and the window frame.  There''s a great light to this and an underlying darkness that I see in many of Cindy Sherman''s photos.</td>', 'Love it, all the things to look at, looks like you built a story around this person, the clothes, shoes, the point of the toes and the window frame.  There''s a great light to this and an underlying darkness that I see in many of Cindy Sherman''s photos.', '2016-03-11 17:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443656, 1177307, 59737, '<td valign="top">Strong movie still type entry like how you positioned your hands.  The background is just odd enough and out of place with the way you''re dressed.  Well done, good luck.</td>', 'Strong movie still type entry like how you positioned your hands.  The background is just odd enough and out of place with the way you''re dressed.  Well done, good luck.', '2016-03-11 17:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443657, 1177318, 59737, '<td valign="top">that''s an interesting character, it''s well focused with good exposure, looks like a street photo to me.  This lacks the energy and underlying darkness that I see in many of Cindy''s images but it''s a photo of someone I could see in a Cindy Sherman photo.</td>', 'that''s an interesting character, it''s well focused with good exposure, looks like a street photo to me.  This lacks the energy and underlying darkness that I see in many of Cindy''s images but it''s a photo of someone I could see in a Cindy Sherman photo.', '2016-03-11 17:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443658, 1177363, 59737, '<td valign="top">Great light, exposure and focus.  Immediate thought to Basic Instinct.  Great photo but lacks the quirkiness I see in many of Cindy Sherman''s photos, this is too perfect for me.</td>', 'Great light, exposure and focus.  Immediate thought to Basic Instinct.  Great photo but lacks the quirkiness I see in many of Cindy Sherman''s photos, this is too perfect for me.', '2016-03-11 17:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443659, 1177214, 59737, '<td valign="top">you nailed the pose, you even got your foot up.  Framing is really good as well, checkered shorts and all.  Great effort</td>', 'you nailed the pose, you even got your foot up.  Framing is really good as well, checkered shorts and all.  Great effort', '2016-03-11 18:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443677, 1177357, 16148, '<td valign="top">Well conceived and executed.</td>', 'Well conceived and executed.', '2016-03-11 19:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443678, 1177339, 16148, '<td valign="top">Vulnerable and lovely!</td>', 'Vulnerable and lovely!', '2016-03-11 19:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443680, 1177333, 16148, '<td valign="top">Takes me back to the 70''s.  Very nice work!</td>', 'Takes me back to the 70''s.  Very nice work!', '2016-03-11 19:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443683, 1177214, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice full frame composition.</td>', 'Nice full frame composition.', '2016-03-11 19:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443689, 1177333, 59737, '<td valign="top">interesting and funny, can see something like this coming from Cindy, items out of place with the sunglasses in bed make the image a little quirky and odd.  The dog''s a great addition.</td>', 'interesting and funny, can see something like this coming from Cindy, items out of place with the sunglasses in bed make the image a little quirky and odd.  The dog''s a great addition.', '2016-03-11 20:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443690, 1177331, 59737, '<td valign="top">I like this, moody with the reflection in a window and then the reflections and images of inside and outside.  It''s not something I would expect to see from Cindy Sherman.</td>', 'I like this, moody with the reflection in a window and then the reflections and images of inside and outside.  It''s not something I would expect to see from Cindy Sherman.', '2016-03-11 20:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443691, 1177361, 59737, '<td valign="top">Clean and nice image, the pills on the nightstand with the wine glass give the image a little bit of an edge which is something I see in Cindy''s photos.  The focus on this is excellent but it doesn''t have the quirkiness/oddness I see in Cindy''s work.</td>', 'Clean and nice image, the pills on the nightstand with the wine glass give the image a little bit of an edge which is something I see in Cindy''s photos.  The focus on this is excellent but it doesn''t have the quirkiness/oddness I see in Cindy''s work.', '2016-03-11 20:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443694, 1177314, 59737, '<td valign="top">good effort, pose is good, I think this would be better if it were a tighter crop , just face with the hand and the book would be interesting.  The extra effort to put the flowers in and the booklet are nice details.</td>', 'good effort, pose is good, I think this would be better if it were a tighter crop , just face with the hand and the book would be interesting.  The extra effort to put the flowers in and the booklet are nice details.', '2016-03-11 20:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443695, 1177206, 59737, '<td valign="top">eerie, I like it, makes me think of a faded memory, doesn''t make me think of Cindy Sherman''s work.</td>', 'eerie, I like it, makes me think of a faded memory, doesn''t make me think of Cindy Sherman''s work.', '2016-03-11 20:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443696, 1177168, 59737, '<td valign="top">This is nicely done, makes me think of a scene from a movie, the shadow across the face and the setting add tension to the photo which I is something I like.</td>', 'This is nicely done, makes me think of a scene from a movie, the shadow across the face and the setting add tension to the photo which I is something I like.', '2016-03-11 20:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443697, 1177358, 59737, '<td valign="top">That''s one spooky doll, definitely a prop I could see in some of Cindy Sherman''s photo series.  I think a different pose with the doll held in a different way may have captured Cindy''s style better or maybe a monochrome treatment on this.</td>', 'That''s one spooky doll, definitely a prop I could see in some of Cindy Sherman''s photo series.  I think a different pose with the doll held in a different way may have captured Cindy''s style better or maybe a monochrome treatment on this.', '2016-03-11 20:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443698, 1177235, 59737, '<td valign="top">Great colors and focus, a strong portrait overall, shows lot''s of emotion.  Not sure that it''s like Cindy Sherman but I like this as a photo.</td>', 'Great colors and focus, a strong portrait overall, shows lot''s of emotion.  Not sure that it''s like Cindy Sherman but I like this as a photo.', '2016-03-11 20:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443699, 1177195, 59737, '<td valign="top">This has the right look to me, if the chair back weren''t visible and the image was a little more in focus think you would have nailed her basic look.  The make-up and lip color give me that odd feeling I get from Cindy''s work and the fierce look in the eyes gives some of the darkness I see in her photos.  Nice job.</td>', 'This has the right look to me, if the chair back weren''t visible and the image was a little more in focus think you would have nailed her basic look.  The make-up and lip color give me that odd feeling I get from Cindy''s work and the fierce look in the eyes gives some of the darkness I see in her photos.  Nice job.', '2016-03-11 21:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443700, 1177334, 59737, '<td valign="top">I know she sometimes photographed inanimate objects but this doesn''t work for me for being in her style.  It''s too straightforward without the commentary many of her pictures seem to have.</td>', 'I know she sometimes photographed inanimate objects but this doesn''t work for me for being in her style.  It''s too straightforward without the commentary many of her pictures seem to have.', '2016-03-11 21:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7443701, 1177360, 59737, '<td valign="top">Agreed it''s a pattern I think she''d wear in a photo.  It''s not her style work and the image could be sharper</td>', 'Agreed it''s a pattern I think she''d wear in a photo.  It''s not her style work and the image could be sharper', '2016-03-11 21:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
