(7445034, 1177359, 103142, '<td valign="top">Looking old? I think you failed that at! Too gorgeous to look old. :)<br/> <br/>Huge congrats on the blue! And on #2! (I was wondering... :)</td>', 'Looking old? I think you failed that at! Too gorgeous to look old. :) Huge congrats on the blue! And on #2! (I was wondering... :)', '2016-03-18 20:46:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445039, 1177354, 59029, '<td valign="top">Grats on the red, Johanna! I have to admit the title confused me a little...as a onetime horse professional, to me the word ''Conformation'' is all about how well a horse is put together.  A horse with good conformation, a good blending of angles and body parts, is a joy to ride.  A horse with poor conformation can feel like riding a sewing machine while it''s falling down a hill. <br/> <br/>So, in this sense, I thought you were referring to how the girl herself is put together - as it is, she is lacing herself into a corset.<br/> <br/>But maybe you meant to convey the sense of Confirmation instead, which is entirely different - the model is looking at the head and wig as though affirming that she too is meeting the rigid sense of beauty so prevalent in society?  So which is it?</td>', 'Grats on the red, Johanna! I have to admit the title confused me a little...as a onetime horse professional, to me the word ''Conformation'' is all about how well a horse is put together.  A horse with good conformation, a good blending of angles and body parts, is a joy to ride.  A horse with poor conformation can feel like riding a sewing machine while it''s falling down a hill.  So, in this sense, I thought you were referring to how the girl herself is put together - as it is, she is lacing herself into a corset. But maybe you meant to convey the sense of Confirmation instead, which is entirely different - the model is looking at the head and wig as though affirming that she too is meeting the rigid sense of beauty so prevalent in society?  So which is it?', '2016-03-18 21:11:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445040, 1177339, 32108, '<td valign="top">I think I''m enjoying your photographic journey nearly as much as mine.</td>', 'I think I''m enjoying your photographic journey nearly as much as mine.', '2016-03-18 21:18:09.000000', NULL, 0),
