(7445219, 1177359, 34659, '<td valign="top">I really like this a lot.  Very indicative of Cindy Sherman IMHO.  Those colors and the expression are just awesome.  Well done and congrats.</td>', 'I really like this a lot.  Very indicative of Cindy Sherman IMHO.  Those colors and the expression are just awesome.  Well done and congrats.', '2016-03-20 22:13:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445220, 1177354, 34659, '<td valign="top">I find this so intriguing and so disturbing.  ha...  Yet I think it is very much in the style of Cindy Sherman.  Well done.  I can''t imagine the setup and patience to make this happen.  Kudos and congrats.</td>', 'I find this so intriguing and so disturbing.  ha...  Yet I think it is very much in the style of Cindy Sherman.  Well done.  I can''t imagine the setup and patience to make this happen.  Kudos and congrats.', '2016-03-20 22:15:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445221, 1177333, 34659, '<td valign="top">Reminds me a bit of Mapplethorpe, Warhol, and Sherman.  (Not sure I got those first two right, but it''s gnawing at me to find what other photog it reminds me of.)  I really like it.  Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Reminds me a bit of Mapplethorpe, Warhol, and Sherman.  (Not sure I got those first two right, but it''s gnawing at me to find what other photog it reminds me of.)  I really like it.  Congrats on the ribbon.', '2016-03-20 22:23:28.000000', NULL, 0),
