(7445450, 1177339, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by flaherma:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey Wendy, congrats on the HM. And more importantly, congrats on taking that huge step out of your comfort zone to do this. Your story is great. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This^^^ times 100.</td>', 'Originally posted by flaherma: Hey Wendy, congrats on the HM. And more importantly, congrats on taking that huge step out of your comfort zone to do this. Your story is great.   This^^^ times 100.', '2016-03-22 16:17:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7505306, 1177339, 37858, '<td valign="top">The photo is great; the explanation is fabulous. Having read it I realize that I''m going through the aging thing too, but I''m a guy so society gives me an 80% pass.  The other 20% I deal with. Really love your zeal (if that''s the right word).</td>', 'The photo is great; the explanation is fabulous. Having read it I realize that I''m going through the aging thing too, but I''m a guy so society gives me an 80% pass.  The other 20% I deal with. Really love your zeal (if that''s the right word).', '2017-03-15 12:54:29.000000', NULL, 0),
